292
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:17,440
Right.

293
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,799
Is he really this unprofessional?

294
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,759
I've worked on film sets for years,

295
00:12:20,759 --> 00:12:22,240
I've never seen anyone so unprofessional!

296
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:23,600
