437
00:16:12,399 --> 00:16:13,879
Just splash it right on stage?

438
00:16:15,360 --> 00:16:16,679
You're very presumptuous.

439
00:16:19,639 --> 00:16:21,000
For today's live stream,

440
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,759
Sandao spent the most money.

441
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:24,000
Quick-drying, refreshing, breathable.

442
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,639
With a subtle fragrance.

443
00:16:24,639 --> 00:16:25,759
You can't leave out a single word.

444
00:16:25,759 --> 00:16:27,039
You have to make him smell the underpants.

445
00:16:27,279 --> 00:16:28,440
Otherwise, forget about the placement fee.

446
00:16:28,879 --> 00:16:29,519
Boss Zheng!

447
00:16:29,519 --> 00:16:30,159
What is it?

448
00:16:30,279 --> 00:16:31,279
I mean, you already took the money,

449
00:16:31,279 --> 00:16:32,120
