478
00:17:25,960 --> 00:17:27,000
I need to go to the bathroom!

479
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,359
You can't go! You can't go!

480
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:30,599
The stream's about to start!

481
00:17:30,599 --> 00:17:31,000
Hold it in!

482
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:31,880
You can't go! You can't go!

483
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,440
You can't go!

484
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:43,119
No, no, I need to use the bathroom!

485
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:44,480
You can't.

486
00:17:44,599 --> 00:17:45,720
You can't. Hold them back!

487
00:17:46,079 --> 00:17:48,000
You can't. Hold it in!

488
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:49,079
You can't.

489
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:50,480
Don't go, don't go.

490
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:52,960
