493
00:17:57,319 --> 00:17:58,759
Those weren't hot and sour.

494
00:17:58,759 --> 00:18:00,240
The chicken feet were just sour!

495
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,279
I'm telling you,

496
00:18:01,279 --> 00:18:02,920
