504
00:18:12,279 --> 00:18:14,359
Me fill in? How do I do that?

505
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:18,960
Three, two, one.

506
00:18:19,279 --> 00:18:22,759
Welcome to Fang Haowen's livestream debut!

507
00:18:22,759 --> 00:18:24,759
Massive giveaway event!

508
00:18:44,559 --> 00:18:45,160
Jump!

509
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,119
Both of us.

510
00:18:49,119 --> 00:18:50,000
Jump!

511
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:02,240
