530
00:20:27,960 --> 00:20:28,799
Hello, everyone.

531
00:20:28,839 --> 00:20:29,920
I'm Fang Haowen.

532
00:20:30,599 --> 00:20:32,440
Thank you for all your encouragement yesterday.

533
00:20:32,680 --> 00:20:34,359
I'm someone who knows how to be grateful.

534
00:20:34,359 --> 00:20:35,319
So today, I've prepared

535
00:20:35,319 --> 00:20:36,400
