536
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:37,920
But livestreaming to sell things

537
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:39,240
isn't our true intention.

538
00:20:39,240 --> 00:20:40,039
We just want... Alice?

539
00:20:40,039 --> 00:20:40,759
Speak, speak.

540
00:20:40,759 --> 00:20:41,440
Mr. Fang,

541
00:20:41,720 --> 00:20:43,160
before you have a heart-to-heart with them,

542
00:20:43,160 --> 00:20:45,319
