550
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:09,759
I almost drove you to depression.

551
00:21:09,759 --> 00:21:10,440
I'm so sorry!

552
00:21:10,839 --> 00:21:11,640
No need, no need, no need!

553
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:12,720
It's fine, it's fine.

554
00:21:12,799 --> 00:21:16,559
Today, I want to use water instead of wine

555
00:21:17,119 --> 00:21:18,000
